# Terms from this project that must never reach the harness's tracked files.
# One case-insensitive extended regex (grep -E) per line; `#` starts a comment, blank lines are skipped.
# lib/leak-guard.sh reads every profiles/*/leak-terms.txt and refuses a tracked file or path that matches.
# List: product and company names, repo names, people's names and handles, hosts, chat channels,
# the tracker site, real access codes, and the ticket key pattern.
#
# examples (replace with this project's own):
# acme
# acme-(web|api)
# staging\.acme\.io
# \bABC-[0-9]+
# \bjane\b
